#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:7
#: dd4216f8242b4b2eb7abea8f72258894
msgid "ESC Calibration"
msgstr "电调校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:9
#: 021c55193770441daf59932780fbd45b
msgid ""
"First, make sure that the correct ESC protocol has been setup. Find your "
"ESC(s) type under :ref:`common-escs-and-motors`, and follow its "
"configuration information."
msgstr ""
"首先，确保已设置正确的 ESC 协议。在 :ref:`common-escs-and-motors` 下找到你的 ESC 类型，并按照其配置信息操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:11
#: e82df98bafd04f5ab8848482d0f75b81
msgid ""
"Vehicles using a traditional PWM controlled ESC (electronic speed "
"controller) for motor output will likely need to be calibrated. **If you are"
" using a digital esc protocol like DShot or are using CAN ESCs then you "
"don't need to calibrate them.**"
msgstr ""
"使用传统 PWM 控制 ESC（电子调速器）进行电机输出的飞行器可能需要进行校准。**如果你使用的是 DShot 等数字 ESC 协议或 CAN "
"ESC，则不需要校准。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:14
#: 891f8fa7d4644f5fb53d4fee637269a8
msgid "Remove the propeller from Planes before starting ESC calibration!"
msgstr "在开始 ESC 校准前，请先取下固定翼飞机的螺旋桨！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:17
#: c554a1fd7824453ab6ea3698e10e9fca
msgid ""
"Calibrating an ESC involves teaching the ESC what range of throttle inputs "
"it should respond to. It needs to know what PWM value on the throttle "
"channel corresponds with the commanding the motor to be off, and what PWM "
"value corresponds with full throttle. These values are stored inside the "
"ESC."
msgstr ""
"ESC 校准包括教导 ESC 它应该响应的油门输入范围。它需要知道油门通道上的哪个 PWM 值对应于命令电机关闭，以及哪个 PWM "
"值对应于全油门。这些值存储在 ESC 内部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:23
#: 02836fe32393451097f7074896399290
msgid ""
"You should not try to calibrate your ESC until you have completed both your "
":ref:`RC inputs <rc-throw-trim>` calibration and your :ref:`servo setup "
"<servo-functions>`. Mission Planner's motor calibration does not work on "
"traditional planes."
msgstr ""
"在完成 :ref:`RC 输入 <rc-throw-trim>` 校准和 :ref:`舵机设置 <servo-functions>` 之前，请勿尝试校准"
" ESC。Mission Planner 的电机校准功能不适用于传统固定翼飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:30
#: 6e0c4445493444af83f04af89b1d350a
msgid "Typical ESC Calibration"
msgstr "典型电调校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:32
#: 0e1ac3cc807f4494beabc7829ec7f1d2
msgid ""
"The most common type of ESC calibration for small electric aircraft is the "
"max-throttle/min-throttle method."
msgstr "小型电动飞机最常见的 ESC 校准类型是最大油门/最小油门方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:35
#: 2c40afdc49d74b0d8ab1a6b8a78c5bbe
msgid ""
"To perform this type of calibration you will need to be able to power to "
"your motor/escs separately from power to the autopilot. Noramlly this is "
"easily accomplished by not conneectting the avehicle's main battery and just"
" powering the autopilot via its USB connection. The steps for calibration "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"要执行此类型的校准，你需要能够为电机/ESC 单独供电，而不向飞控供电。通常，只需不连接飞行器的主电池，仅通过 USB "
"连接为飞控供电即可。校准步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:39
#: 3c0cc2f360f34f1b8c23d43cb38dd47a
msgid ""
"start with the autopilot powered via USB, but with the ESC unpowered "
"(normally just by leaving the flight battery disconnected) and propeller, if"
" a Plane, removed"
msgstr "从通过 USB 为飞控供电开始，但 ESC 不上电（通常只需不连接飞行电池），如果是固定翼飞机则需取下螺旋桨"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:41
#: 1636ca23ae424cd6b4ef347eed0c8013
msgid "switch to MANUAL flight/control mode"
msgstr "切换到 Manual 飞行/控制模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:42
#: 21d926c458254f0683141c31d062272e
msgid "disable the safety switch (if fitted) and arm the vehicle"
msgstr "禁用安全开关（如有）并解锁飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:43
#: ddc5ac4c289f4074b70ba8450ef64186
msgid "move the throttle stick on your transmitter to maximum"
msgstr "将发射机上的油门摇杆推至最大"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:44
#: 9021ab56b116443cbe3ad8cdc5ddc4b2
msgid "add power to the ESC by connecting the flight battery"
msgstr "通过连接飞行电池为 ESC 供电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:46
#: 19f156a3c4c942928419a893e1cf3c20
msgid ""
"At this stage the ESC/motor should beep to indicate that it is in ESC "
"calibration mode. Typically it will be 2 or 3 quick beeps, but the motor "
"won't turn."
msgstr "此时 ESC/电机应发出蜂鸣声，表示已进入 ESC 校准模式。通常会发出 2 或 3 声短促蜂鸣，但电机不会转动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:50
#: 7c4a560b8e24483ea1d82b266361e1bc
msgid "now lower the throttle stick rapidly to zero"
msgstr "现在迅速将油门杆降至零"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:51
#: 09462f5bc99e4effa84ee18150c8c61a
msgid ""
"the ESC should beep to indicate it has accepted the new calibration range"
msgstr "ESC 应发出蜂鸣声，表示已接受新的校准范围"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:53
#: 7fab9c39b9ec4128ae15dd55749caa7e
msgid ""
"now slowly raise the throttle and check that the motor responds correctly"
msgstr "现在缓慢提升油门并检查电机是否正确响应"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:57
#: 9637cc08cb704f83992a746c62ac2a71
msgid "Alternative ESC Calibration"
msgstr "替代电调校准方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:59
#: c9fb941c132848a1a1065a4cf401a0af
msgid ""
"If the typical ESC calibration method above doesn't work, instead adjust the"
" SERVOx_MIN and SERVOx_MAX values on the appropriate servo channel (SERVOx) "
"you had set as the Throttle channel in ref:`servo setup <servo-functions>` "
"to match the existing range of your ESC."
msgstr ""
"如果上述典型的 ESC 校准方法不起作用，则可以在 ref:`舵机设置 <servo-functions>` "
"中设置为油门通道的相应舵机通道（SERVOx）上调整 SERVOx_MIN 和 SERVOx_MAX 值，以匹配 ESC 的现有范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:63
#: 216f436487954ba39fa3e58ef135bee2
msgid ""
"To use this method slowly raise the SERVOx_MIN value until it is set to a "
"value just below the point that the motor comes on. A value about 20 PWM "
"points below the point where the motor starts turning is usually a good "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"使用此方法时，缓慢提高 SERVOx_MIN 值，直到刚好低于电机启动的临界点。通常将该值设在电机开始转动点以下约 20 个 PWM "
"单位是一个合适的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:68
#: ef8b981e4f0f4bb79f1aa7c0c137d8f7
msgid ""
"Next move the transmitter stick to full throttle and adjust SERVOx_MAX until"
" maximum RPM is reached. You can use a tachometer, or just use the sound of "
"the motor as a guide."
msgstr "接下来将遥控器杆推到满油门，并调整 SERVOx_MAX 直到达到最高转速。可以使用转速表，或只凭电机声音作为判断依据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:73
#: 458a1268a1214f5f993dcd5d6df828c5
msgid "Reversing PWM based ESCs"
msgstr "反向 PWM 电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:75
#: 2e3a877bdc2141c487bcd2cc20aa628b
msgid ""
"If you are using a reversing ESC for reverse thrust for Plane( see "
":ref:`Automatic Landing<automatic-landing>` section on Reverse Thrust "
"Landing ) or normal Rovers/Subs, and its PWM based rather than CAN, OneShot,"
" or DShot, then you may need to calibrate it for minimum and maximum PWM "
"values. Sometimes, a button is provided for setting full forward, neutral, "
"and full reverse. In this case, you will need to setup an RCx_OPTION on an "
"RC channel to allow setting full reverse manually. Follow the manufacturers "
"instructions for calibration."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在使用反推 ESC 为固定翼飞机提供反推力（参见 :ref:`自动降落 <automatic-landing>` "
"章节中的反推着陆部分）或用于普通地面车/水下机器人，且该 ESC 基于 PWM 而非 CAN、OneShot 或 DShot，则可能需要校准其最小和最大"
" PWM 值。有时会提供一个按钮用于设置全速前进、中立和全速倒车。在这种情况下，需要在 RC 通道上设置 RCx_OPTION "
"以允许手动设置全速倒车。请按照制造商说明进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:77
#: f5ff3209bc8e466eb92aa2923ed876d3
msgid ""
"Some ESCs just fix the calibration, in which case you may need to adjust the"
" servo/motor's output trim position to be slightly different than 1500 us to"
" obtain zero thrust."
msgstr "某些 ESC 固定校准，在这种情况下，你可能需要将舵机/电机的输出微调位置调整为略微不同于 1500 us，以获得零推力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:79
#: c6e4c7dbe0234d5e9e08d173e4db5f12
msgid ""
"Copter/Sub MOTORx output's trim position cannot be changed, its always "
"1500us for bi-directional and 1000us for uni-directional motors. Plane and "
"Rover's Throttle output's can have their ``SERVOx_MIN/MAX/TRIM`` values "
"changed as required."
msgstr ""
"Copter/Sub 的 MOTORx 输出微调位置无法更改，双向电机始终为 1500us，单向电机始终为 1000us。Plane 和 Rover "
"的油门输出可以根据需要更改其 ``SERVOx_MIN/MAX/TRIM`` 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:81
#: 66d2ce8642c349b9a6a6e6bd4013591e
msgid ""
"BLHeli ESCs can be set for bi-directional operation using the \"ROTATION\" "
"parameter. Usually they default to full reverse at 1000 us, full forward at "
"2000 us, and zero at 1500us, but these can be adjusted using the appropriate"
" BLHeli suite application."
msgstr ""
"BLHeli ESC 可以使用「ROTATION」参数设置为双向操作。通常它们默认为 1000 us 时全反向，2000 us 时全前进，1500us "
"时为零，但这些可以使用适当的 BLHeli 套件应用程序进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:83
#: 6053b9aeaf6e4b53aad55338b1b38715
msgid "AM32 ESCs have similar settings."
msgstr "AM32 电调具有类似的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:86
#: 2895e068551544fab25b4a0571e5f199
msgid "Brushed Motor ESCS"
msgstr "有刷电机电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:88
#: 9e3c4a6301464d14ad23d79dea84bb21
msgid ""
"Most brushed motor ESCs have a fixed calibration which will require manually"
" setting the throttle output's ``SERVOx_MAX``, and ``SERVOx_MIN`` parameters"
" to match the ESCs maximum points. ``SERVOx_TRIM`` would be set so that the "
"motor is stopped, if using a reversing ESC."
msgstr ""
"大多数有刷电机 ESC 具有固定校准，需要手动设置油门输出的 ``SERVOx_MAX`` 和 ``SERVOx_MIN`` 参数以匹配 ESC "
"的最大点。如果使用反向 ESC，则将 ``SERVOx_TRIM`` 设置为使电机停止的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:91
#: fa6e0b3f85504adc891def040cb1d4d4
msgid "Other ESC Protocols"
msgstr "其他电调协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-calibration.rst:93
#: cd0adb6ebed1465f868373d415d25097
msgid ""
"New ESC's using protocols other than PWM often do not require calibration. "
"Some examples include CAN and DShot. The digital signals replace the need "
"for PWM calibration and are usually pre-set to a range of 1000us to 2000us."
msgstr ""
"使用 PWM 以外协议的新型 ESC 通常不需要校准。例如 CAN 和 DShot。数字信号取代了 PWM 校准的需求，通常预设范围为 1000us 至"
" 2000us。"
